# Partials — 90 bpm, E minor, about a minute. A demo of the additive voice
# (src/additive.rs): every pitched sound is a stack of sine partials.
#
#   beats  0-24   OPEN    one note opens from a single sine into a wide
#                         cluster: 1 to 256 partials, the tilt brightening,
#                         the partials drifting apart and fanning out
#   beats 24-56   COMB    a pad whose spectrum a comb sweeps through, a
#                         phaser on the partials, over a bass that morphs
#                         from square (odd partials) to saw and stretches
#   beats 56-80   ORGAN   a partial table of the song's own (organ ranks,
#                         panned) carries the tune

bpm 90
gate 0.95
tail 5

section OPEN 0..24
section COMB 24..56
section ORGAN 56..80

automate reverb_wet
0.22
automate reverb_decay
0.75

partials organ 1 2:0.7:-0.3 3:0.45:0.3 4:0.3 6:0.2:-0.5 8:0.15:0.5 10:0.08

# --- OPEN: one note, from a sine to a cluster
track cloud additive add_partials=1 add_tilt=1.6 attack=2 release=4 vel=0.7 reverb_send=0.4
>OPEN E2:24
automate cloud.add_partials
1 256:16@smooth
automate cloud.add_tilt
1.6 0.7:16@smooth R:4 1.2:4@smooth
automate cloud.add_spread
0 40:20@smooth
automate cloud.add_width
0 1:12@smooth

# --- COMB: a swept pad over a morphing bass
track pad additive add_partials=256 add_tilt=0.6 add_comb_depth=0.9 add_comb_freq=0.06 add_spread=6 add_width=0.6 attack=0.8 release=2 vel=0.6 gain=0.55 reverb_send=0.35
>COMB [E3 G3 B3 D4]:8 [C3 E3 G3 B3]:8 [A2 C3 E3 G3]:8 [B2 D#3 F#3 A3]:8
automate pad.add_comb_phase
0 >COMB 25:32
track bass additive add_partials=96 add_tilt=1 add_odd=1 vel=0.75 attack=0.01 release=0.3 pan=0
>COMB (E1:1.5 E1:0.5 E2:1 E1:1)x2 (C1:1.5 C1:0.5 C2:1 C1:1)x2 (A0:1.5 A0:0.5 A1:1 A0:1)x2 (B0:1.5 B0:0.5 B1:1 B0:1)x2
automate bass.add_odd
1 >COMB 0:16@smooth 1:16@smooth
automate bass.add_stretch
0 >COMB R:16 0.004:8@smooth 0:8@smooth
track kit kit=909 gain=0.7
>COMB (BD SD)x16
>ORGAN (BD SD)x10 BD:4

# --- ORGAN: a partial table plays the tune
track organ additive=organ add_tilt=0 attack=0.03 release=0.4 vel=0.6 reverb_send=0.3
>ORGAN E4:1.5 F#4:0.5 G4:1 B4:1 A4:2 G4:1 F#4:1 E4:1.5 D4:0.5 E4:1 G4:1 F#4:4 A4:2 G4:1 F#4:1 E4:4
track drone additive add_partials=32 add_tilt=1.4 add_spread=8 attack=1 release=3 vel=0.5 reverb_send=0.3
>ORGAN [E2 B2]:8 [C2 G2]:8 [D2 A2]:4 [E2 B2]:4
